    "text": "We see three alternative Western routes that wouldn't able us to avoid the intrusion of pavement and dramatic land modification into our woods and wetlands. The Cardinal Road. The Western end of Cardinal Road already has short informal pedestrian connections to 123 via the Ajayson apartments that could be modified to become a more standard trail. The first one is the Eton Place and Fairfax Boulevard. The length of 7 foot wide sidewalk already existing on Eton Place and Fairfax Boulevard could be extended both westward to 123 and eastward to Boulevard Marketplace or users will find a connection to the existing eastern"
