    "speaker_source_detail": "Heuristic (text-based speaker guess)",
    "start": 1681.7800000000002,
    "end": 1714.6200000000001,
    "text": "George Nitor Trail and the Fairwoods neighbor way. Unlike the rest of Fairfax Boulevard, this stretch involves no intersections or driveway crossings. Via the Willowwood Redell redevelopment. The Willowwood Office Park is in planning for mixed use redevelopment. This is an opportunity to route the George Nitor Trail along the back edge as has been done at the city's Main Street Marketplace. The connection to 123 could continue at the back of the hotel properties. The future of this project is an opportunity to acquire the open space parcel at 10 to 70"
