    "speaker_source": "heuristic",
    "speaker_source_detail": "Heuristic (text-based speaker guess)",
    "start": 1714.6200000000001,
    "end": 1752.38,
    "text": "Fairfax Boulevard thus completing a chain of city owned preserves and wildlife corridors along Acadaine Creek from city limit to city limit. At the same time, let's improve access to these natural preserves by controlling the invasive exotic plant species that are choking out access for native flora, fauna, and citizens alike by the density of their investigations. Thank you. Our next speaker is Thomas Strange."
