    "speaker_source_detail": "Heuristic (text-based speaker guess)",
    "start": 1752.46,
    "end": 1784.98,
    "text": "I would also like to start off by thanking us for taking the consideration of the environmental impact that this project has had. I would also like to raise concerns that I have talked with a lot of the fellow Fairfax citizens here. It's a very invasive project where the agricultural and how many trees are being removed. How is that going to affect this long term? So we are planting new trees to replace these. Neutrients don't provide the same amount of oxygen and do the same thing as old and well"
