    "text": "vestitries. Even the thought of taking another 500 trees down is just it's kind of almost sickening. The amount of money that is going into this is coming out of our tax dollars as well. It's not. We're still contributing somehow. It's kind of just got wrenching to see how much deforestation has occurred. I was hoping that you can take this into consideration as everyone that I have talked to is feeling the same way. All the residents that live in most bewildered areas, it's kind of really sad to see all"
