    "speaker_source": "heuristic",
    "speaker_source_detail": "Heuristic (text-based speaker guess)",
    "start": 1852.26,
    "end": 1889.94,
    "text": "stated that community, they conducted community outreach with Cambridge station regarding the GST and that outreach occurred in August of 2020. In the past two weeks, this group has finally been provided the details of that outreach. And here's what we've learned. The email communication announced seeing the GST meeting only went to the then H.O.A. President and did not specify that he should invite others in the community to that meeting."
