    "speaker_source_detail": "Heuristic (text-based speaker guess)",
    "start": 1889.94,
    "end": 1923.1399999999999,
    "text": "As a result, only three of 118 homes in Cambridge Station were represented at that meeting. That's 2.5%. The city's presentation did not specify that the trail would be paved. It did not specify that more than 500 trees would need to be cut down. It did not specify that 19% of the tree canopy would be destroyed due to the combined"
