    "start": 1923.1399999999999,
    "end": 1959.18,
    "text": "environmental impact of stream restoration and the George Snyder Trail. The government did not specify that it would take more than 100 years for the oak and hickory forest that makes up the eastern portion of the planned GST project to recover. In addition to the community outreach, city staff also discussed the environmental impact to wildlife as a result of the GST at the recent work session."
