    "speaker_source": "heuristic",
    "speaker_source_detail": "Heuristic (text-based speaker guess)",
    "start": 1959.18,
    "end": 1989.82,
    "text": "Two weeks ago, city staff advised the council that the environmental impact studies conducted were limited to protected and endangered species for which there were none in that area. So tonight, I'd like to share with you this picture of a northern spotted owl which was taken in my side yard. After snapping this picture, the little guy flew off to his home in C1."
