    "speaker_source": "heuristic",
    "speaker_source_detail": "Heuristic (text-based speaker guess)",
    "start": 1989.82,
    "end": 2024.0600000000002,
    "text": "Northern spotted owls have been protected by the endangered species since 1990. I'd also like to share this picture of a bald eagle in C1, right in the area that the city is currently destroying for creek restoration. As you know, bald eagles are protected by the bald eagle protection act. Please stop the destruction of our wildlife and our forests."
