    "speaker_source": "heuristic",
    "speaker_source_detail": "Heuristic (text-based speaker guess)",
    "start": 2024.0600000000002,
    "end": 2057.42,
    "text": "Please vote no to the George Snyder Trail. Thank you. Our next speaker is Shelley Vance. Good evening, I'm Shelley Vance. I live on Cambridge, C1, Cambridge Station. I come again to speak about the level of public outreach that the city wants to take credit for with the current plan for the George Snyder Trail."
