    "speaker_source": "heuristic",
    "speaker_source_detail": "Heuristic (text-based speaker guess)",
    "start": 2057.42,
    "end": 2088.18,
    "text": "At the public work session two weeks ago on March 11, the issue of public outreach and public engagement was broached by the council. The staff was specifically asked if there had been public outreach and the staff responded that their head been without giving details. The idea of public outreach conjures up images of e-mails, door flyers, letters to homeowners by US post, news items in the city scene and public meetings held at City Hall or the Sherwood Center."
