    "speaker_source": "heuristic",
    "speaker_source_detail": "Heuristic (text-based speaker guess)",
    "start": 2088.18,
    "end": 2119.18,
    "text": "The expression public outreach covers a multitude of methods. Let's look at the public outreach that actually took place in 2020. July 17, 2020, public outreach e-mail from the city's Kathy Salgado was sent to the HOA Presidents of the three nearest communities. The rest of the e-mail recipients were city staff members. During the meeting at Miss Salgado asked to schedule a meeting to share with the communities to brief the residents and take questions."
