    "speaker_source": "heuristic",
    "speaker_source_detail": "Heuristic (text-based speaker guess)",
    "start": 2119.18,
    "end": 2149.74,
    "text": "All good intentions. The actual public outreach meeting took place on August 20. At that meeting there were the same three HOA Presidents on the original city e-mail invitation and there were two additional residents from those target HOAs. In other words there were five property owners. There are 823 properties among the three HOAs. The five homeowners attend and five homeowners attended."
