    "speaker": "Mcquillin",
    "speaker_source": "heuristic",
    "speaker_source_detail": "Heuristic (text-based speaker guess)",
    "start": 2183.18,
    "end": 2213.86,
    "text": "in the vicinity of the GST. The project timeline slide takes credit for associated outreach activities and trail alignment review with the Moesby Woods HOA. This is not the first time I have spoken on this issue of poor public outreach. I spoke of this in December of 23 January of 24 and February of 25. Every time the city council or staff alludes to public outreach or public engagement"
