    "text": "and omits the details, I will cite specifics and reiterate that whatever public outreach and engagement there was was insufficient and ineffective. Thank you. Can I ask that we not applaud? This is a public comment and it's a city council meeting. So we're listening very attentively to you. So I would ask that you create some decorum in the chamber."
