    "end": 2650.14,
    "text": "I don't think it's a good idea. And I did not hear the trees singing. I feel pretty. Oh, so pretty. Because I think if they could scream, they would make a hell of a lot of noise. We can do a whole lot better than killing our trees, having paying money, foolishly. And I've been, you know, that's going to go screw you. I've been working my fany off at the police station and BAR, my unfavorite thing."
