    "start": 2650.14,
    "end": 2686.5,
    "text": "Seven men, thank you. Decided we should have this big column, and it was supervised, and it was a mess. You should leave a site looking like it did when you came except for that stupid ugly brick thing. They did not. And I have spent almost 20 hours trying to fix it and a lot of money. Thank you. Thank you. Thank you. Our next speaker, Sandy Shen. Hi, I'm Sandy Shen from Vienna."
