    "text": "Thank you for this opportunity to talk. I just wanted to mention that I attended the walkthrough of the proposed George signer's trail, and also sat through the work session a couple weeks ago. And I just sincerely hope that you consider alternatives to the full trail. And a minimum don't do the Eastern half, which cuts through some very steep woods and paves a little highway through narrow woods."
