    "speaker_source_detail": "Heuristic (text-based speaker guess)",
    "start": 2716.54,
    "end": 2754.18,
    "text": "And I'm not that familiar with the Western half, but I understand there's some alternatives there. So I just want to appreciate your deliberations a couple weeks ago. And I hope you follow through on some alternatives. Just like to remind you that trees contribute a lot to the air to erosion control. Their valuable resources, and they can't speak for themselves. So we owe it to the trees to be somewhat conscious of their value to all of our lives."
