    "speaker_source_detail": "Heuristic (text-based speaker guess)",
    "start": 2784.38,
    "end": 2816.74,
    "text": "And I'm speaking against the George Snodger Trail Project. I just want to remind you that in Cambridge station, we fought to save this very same forest back in 2007 when we reached a compromise with the City Council at that time. There was transparency back then. We had several meetings with the City Council and staff members. We asked questions and they answered them."
