    "speaker_source_detail": "Heuristic (text-based speaker guess)",
    "start": 2816.74,
    "end": 2850.98,
    "text": "At that time, instead of raising the whole forest and putting in four ball fields in Stappard Park, which is on the eastern side of the trail, the City Putian Only One Ball Field and left this strip of forest. They also put in a lovely pristine little gravel walking pathway through these old growth trees. Both Earth Day and Arbor Day are usually celebrated in April."
