    "start": 2850.98,
    "end": 2881.6600000000003,
    "text": "On Arbor Day, a few symbolic trees are ceremonially planted. But both of these events need to address the paving over the fear bits of our station that we have left in Fairfax City. I realized that paved property is usually taxable property. But ripping out a small forest in order to put in a big paved road makes no sense."
