    "speaker_source_detail": "Heuristic (text-based speaker guess)",
    "start": 2881.6600000000003,
    "end": 2915.22,
    "text": "That ADA compliant road could take place on a parallel existing pavement paved road that the City already maintains. With the GST removal of 500 mature trees and removal of tons of forest floor occurs to create an unnecessary, wide paved road that cuts through the middle of Stappard Park, this little urban forest will be no more."
