    "start": 2945.8599999999997,
    "end": 2976.1,
    "text": "I want to start up by thanking you all. The first council that is really seriously considered our concerns. We had some other members on previous ones, but the first one that has really decided, hey, we need to resolve this. We're now faced, I guess, with cancelling or modifying. I happen to be in favor of modifying. Both the Eastern and the Western. You could have a full build. If you used existing infrastructure, a fillable toss that came up with four options for the Western part that should be considered."
