    "speaker_source_detail": "Heuristic (text-based speaker guess)",
    "start": 4296.54,
    "end": 4329.66,
    "text": "not in favor of the project and some residents with concerns specific to their properties which we certainly would look to address during the next phase which is our right away acquisition phase moving this project forward. Turn it back over to you. Thank you so where we are this evening is that the public hearing phase this is an opportunity for the project team to present the project to a public audience. This is technically the the public hearing is something that is required as part of V dot funded projects. This project is not a V dot funded project this is an"
