    "speaker_source_detail": "Heuristic (text-based speaker guess)",
    "start": 4329.66,
    "end": 4364.3,
    "text": "NVTA funded project that said we are using the same process of the public hearing at the same stage for consistency. As part of the public hearing individuals have the opportunity to have their comments recorded either tonight at the meeting or the or the public comment period which will be open for 10 days and so we have this is a new public comment period and so the engaged fairfax page is open for public comment as well all of those comments will be recorded and entered into a public hearing record and the city staff will provide responses to those comments. In terms of"
