    "speaker_source": "heuristic",
    "speaker_source_detail": "Heuristic (text-based speaker guess)",
    "start": 4364.3,
    "end": 4398.54,
    "text": "notification these are the various ways that the public hearing has been advertised there have been signs in the neighborhood there have been newspaper ads e-mail specific associations it's been in social media posts and in city clips e-mails. So in terms of the next steps as you know tonight is the 60% design public hearing we would move into right-of-way acquisition over the summer and then construction would occur in approximately a year and also take approximately one year. That concludes our"
