    "start": 4398.54,
    "end": 4433.34,
    "text": "presentation we'd be happy to take any questions prior to the public hearing. Are there questions of the next step? Council member Hall. I would like to again express by disdain for this project and that I do not believe that it is supported by the community I think it's very misleading that well I guess a general process procedure maybe is that when when the engaged page updates with a new design or things like that it appears that the previous comments seem to disappear and I recognize"
