    "speaker_source_detail": "Heuristic (text-based speaker guess)",
    "start": 4433.9800000000005,
    "end": 4468.14,
    "text": "there might be a benefit to that and that maybe the comments are outdated and don't necessarily pertain to the current plan that people are looking at but it will be really beneficial I think as a procedural opportunity that all comments are archived on there and are visible and maybe there's just a line item that says these were 40% 30% whatever change. I had a couple residents reach out and they were very unhappy that they couldn't see the previous comments. So forgive me for asking this I probably asked this last time but what is the width of the sidewalk that is being generated"
