    "text": "Our next speaker is Carolyn Pitches. Good evening, Mayor and Council. My name is Carolyn Pitches. I'm chair of the City of Fairfax School Board. I live at 10840. First, I'm here to provide clarity on the City of Fairfax School's budget and the school boards role in managing it responsibly. The school board basis significant"
