    "end": 6606.46,
    "text": "structural challenges when it comes to crafting our annual budget. We are required to approve our school budget before the Commonwealth finalizes its own budget and before Fairfax County public schools adopt theirs. This means that we're building our budget based on two layers of estimates. To develop a reasonably informed budget, we closely monitor a range of dynamic factors, but despite our best efforts to anticipate and adjust, this layered uncertainty makes the process inherently difficult. This is not a result of mismanagement, but of a structural process that requires"
