    "text": "with a diverse lineup of free and ticketed programming. Our entire festival is free and open to the public. This includes authors, readings, panel discussions, writing workshops, and children's activities, featuring prominent writers like Amy Tan, Colson Whitehead, Steven King, and David Graham, alongside emerging authors, and national authors. Events are held across Fairfax locations,"
