    "start": 7182.78,
    "end": 7227.42,
    "text": "The housing that has been done on former PVI site resulted in 200 new students between 2022 and 2024. At an additional cost of $4.5 million. I've read a comment in an analysis by Don Pracher which stated that inflation in our area is running 2.7 to 3.4% and GDP is about 3%."
