    "speaker_source": "heuristic",
    "speaker_source_detail": "Heuristic (text-based speaker guess)",
    "start": 7266.62,
    "end": 7302.54,
    "text": "Good evening. I'm Paul Hopkins. I live at 10773 Crest Street. I'm going to talk about property tax for a minute. My wife and I have lived in Verifact City for 19 years. I really enjoy it here. We recently received a 25-25 real estate property notice assessment change. The proposed tax increase is estimated to be 20.1% higher than it was last year. Typically it's been running 3 to 5% each year."
