    "speaker_source": "heuristic",
    "speaker_source_detail": "Heuristic (text-based speaker guess)",
    "start": 7302.54,
    "end": 7332.86,
    "text": "This was a shock to us. When we looked at it closer and talked to some of the neighbors, it turns out that half of the increase is due to a 10% plus up in the cost property values. That's common throughout the whole neighborhood. The other half is due to the increased real estate tax rates that are being proposed. We're retired and we're on a fixed income. For us to come up with more"
